{"id":"e8np1pwjxwfw1ufq18bfrnq0o","title":"加密协议收入集中度达47%：为何多数龙头代币跑输BTC","originalTitle":"头部协议垄断 47% 收入，为何多数龙头代币跑输 BTC","summary":"加密协议收入集中度达47%，但多数龙头代币跑输BTC。核心差异在于：1）协议收入与代币持有者现金流分配（如Hyperliquid年手续费8.95亿美元但未向持币者分配）；2）潜在市场规模（如Derive链上期权名义交易量142亿美元）；3）叙事驱动（如Zcash因隐私需求上涨592%，Pearl通过PoUW切入AI算力市场）。","reason":"原文指出头部协议收入集中度达47%，但多数龙头代币跑输BTC，需结合市场规模、叙事及现金流分配等维度综合判断代币表现","source":{"name":"链捕手 ChainCatcher"},"links":{"original":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2305483"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T06:09:53.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T06:29:38.029Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T06:29:38.029Z","category":"crypto-defi","tags":["研究报告","DeFi","Layer2","稳定币","比特币"],"score":64,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"stablecoin","name":"稳定币"},{"slug":"defi","name":"DeFi 与链上"},{"slug":"layer2","name":"Layer2 与扩容"},{"slug":"crypto-market","name":"行情异动"},{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}